In Classic WoW, most warlocks use **Voidwalkers** because their **Sacrifice** ability provides a crucial damage shield that significantly increases survivability against physical attacks, which are common during leveling. While the Succubus offers better crowd control (Seduction) and damage, the Voidwalker's ability to tank and absorb damage makes it the safer, more reliable choice for solo questing and surviving unexpected pulls. [end of text]


